{"version":1,"key":"card:30","content":{"id":30,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"记忆分为两种机制：存储和提取。存储和提取是呈负相关的，存储过程越容易，则提取过程就会越困难。举两个例子：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"858687f3-705f-4ba1-8cec-795628370461","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"课堂笔记。有的同学时边听讲边记笔记，记笔记这个过程就是存储过程，像这种未加思考的存储过程，是相当容易的，但是提取过程就会比较困难，过了一段时间，可能就完全不记得笔记上的内容了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"caa8ad3f-9b56-4645-8503-5d232cf8551a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2be8d9fd-19a8-472b-9a79-e6afc6950e26","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"阅读笔记。在读书时，会直接在书本上进行划线标记重点，这种没有任何加工的存储，提取也是比较困难的，过了一段时间，你完全不会意识到划线的内容是什么。有的时候还会重复阅读，但如果仅仅是阅读一遍而没有任何思考，过了一段时间还是容易忘记。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a3fd8d6-ee8b-4e2c-b017-0c4992680c46","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"731e2093-2695-4433-bc16-493a80852c50","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"5c510187-d503-478c-ad39-eac82aeb797e","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"基于此，我们要求存储的过程存在一定的难度，这样才能保证在提取知识是比较轻松，这就是必要难度理论。现在的问题是，如何让存储有难度呢？重点在于一定要有思考，不是机械的摘抄，要用自己的语言复述一遍。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"925d6d17-b0f7-4b7a-8270-4d1b1ef1ca3f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"还是以上面两个例子举例：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3fe1a2d5-15f1-43ae-b7e6-331c5339e746","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"不要机械的抄写黑板上的内容，不如好好听讲，等到课后，用自己的语言将课堂内容复述一遍","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0627768e-e02b-43ca-bd3a-bc478eb0ab7f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2b968585-770e-49c0-be47-7256cbdd8f87","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"在阅读的过程中，一定要有所记录，对于精彩或重点的部分，我们要用自己的语言复述一遍","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"46a4b690-8846-4634-bbe8-0a21cc731901","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1660a1ff-8f8e-4092-ba9e-66fe8a03bf8e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"fb667135-967c-4f9d-8458-971355abe5cf","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"上面的两个例子，都强调不是简单的摘抄，而是用自己的语言复述一遍记录下面，添加这么一道复述的工序，会让存储的过程不再是那么的简单，我们记忆的会更加的深刻。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6b4f37d4-7b70-4dc3-8134-a8e7ae5bfe87","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"参考：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e3b2cebf-4239-40b6-bd4a-b4701a8fd299","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"《卡片笔记写作法》","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b9398948-e3c4-4372-bed4-f161179fa827","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7ca58816-06d1-4a04-9058-f1c3fd0656b4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7e1cf505-d6cb-472e-890a-d33ff3554fd8","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"tags":["学习方法"],"createTime":1688953292717,"updateTime":1793532515238,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532515238}}